  "description": "This is a brain-training game where the text color and the word’s meaning don’t match—choose the correct answer!\n\nThe rules are simple:\nFocus on the color of the word at the top of the screen, and choose from the options below based on the word’s meaning.\n\nIt looks easy, yet it tricks you every time…\nEnjoy the oddly challenging fun of the Stroop effect in a casual, pick-up-and-play format!\n\nWith 4-choice, 6-choice, and 8-choice modes, the difficulty increases step by step—great for beginners and for those who want a real mental workout.\n\nDesigned for quick sessions, it’s perfect for short breaks in your day!",
